      "review_description": "Great customer service, John took the time to come to the house, get up on the roof with me and point out the best location for the system. No pressure sales tactics, he left it completely up to me to research and decide on the system based on his initial recommendation/quote. Quick to install the system, only had to wait for the panels to arrive from overseas, but was kept up to date constantly. Arrived on time on the day of installation, explained what was going to happen and got on with the job. Very neat installation, with all wiring concealed in walls and roof. Even moved my sky light and roof vent to make better use of the roof for the panels. Based on my experience, I have recommended him to others interested in going solar.",
